        "language": "english",
        "review": "Short but sweet disco-like game. After completing two endings, I'm left with the feeling that my playthrough was somehow... cut-short? I never even saw a skill check for 50+% of the available skills. This leads me to think this game while short, is probably very lateral in it's writing. I think I'm still gonna go for a third ending with some... radically different choices.\n\nThe writing has some good jokes and I enjoyed the story generally quite a bit. I only wish there had been more of it, but alas I know the realities of micro indie development very well. I hope the team can continue developing games and very much look forward to what they make next!",
